WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:17.673
Ellen's parents told her the news.

2
00:00:17.674 --> 00:00:26.176
A man—a brave hero—was willing to die for her.

3
00:00:26.177 --> 00:00:34.981
She jumped off her bed in joy. "Carry me to the lake!"

4
00:00:34.982 --> 00:00:41.633
Servants carried Ellen to the middle of the lake bed.

5
00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:45.434
A small boat was waiting there in the mud.

6
00:00:45.435 --> 00:00:50.899
It was filled with food and other supplies.

7
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:58.605
The prince arrived, waving. "Here I am!"

8
00:00:58.606 --> 00:01:02.462
Still under the witch's spell, Ellen blinked.

9
00:01:02.463 --> 00:01:16.805
"I know him," she thought.

10
00:01:16.806 --> 00:01:20.930
The prince climbed into the hole.

11
00:01:20.931 --> 00:01:28.011
Water magically began flowing over the stone.

12
00:01:28.012 --> 00:01:36.291
"It's working," he thought. "The lake is filling up again."

13
00:01:36.292 --> 00:01:44.551
Ellen told the others to leave.

14
00:01:44.552 --> 00:01:50.603
She lay in the boat with her eyes shut.

15
00:01:50.604 --> 00:01:56.532
"This is very kind of you," she said.

16
00:01:56.533 --> 00:02:00.448
"You made me happy," the prince said.

17
00:02:00.449 --> 00:02:08.464
"We laughed all the time."

18
00:02:08.465 --> 00:02:15.960
Time went by, and waves began flowing over the stone.

19
00:02:15.961 --> 00:02:19.511
As the water rose, the boat began to float.

20
00:02:19.512 --> 00:02:23.595
The princess fell asleep.

21
00:02:23.596 --> 00:02:26.480
"Ellen!" The prince was hurt.

22
00:02:26.481 --> 00:02:30.115
"Your father promised that you would comfort me!"

23
00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:37.702
She yawned. "I'm too sleepy."

24
00:02:37.703 --> 00:02:41.080
The prince sighed.

25
00:02:41.081 --> 00:02:45.859
"Sleep then, darling. Don't worry about me."

26
00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.899
"You are very kind," she said.

27
00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:56.245
"Thank you. I think I will go back to sleep."

28
00:02:56.246 --> 00:03:03.002
"Can you give me some food first?" the prince asked.

29
00:03:03.003 --> 00:03:12.603
Reaching for the food, she looked at him for the first time.

30
00:03:12.604 --> 00:03:17.943
"You don't look very well."

31
00:03:17.944 --> 00:03:23.575
"I'm fine," he said. "I just need to eat."

32
00:03:23.576 --> 00:03:26.562
The princess fed him.

33
00:03:26.563 --> 00:03:33.854
Soon the sun went down, and the moon rose over the lake.

34
00:03:33.855 --> 00:03:39.921
By now waters were gushing around the prince's waist.

35
00:03:39.922 --> 00:03:44.016
"There's plenty of water now," Ellen said.

36
00:03:44.017 --> 00:03:47.912
"Let's go swimming!"

37
00:03:47.913 --> 00:03:50.060
The prince shook his head.

38
00:03:50.061 --> 00:03:54.602
"I'm afraid I've had my last swim," he said sadly.

39
00:03:54.603 --> 00:04:03.987
Ellen laughed. "Silly me. I forgot!"

40
00:04:03.988 --> 00:04:07.516
The water kept rising, reaching his neck.

41
00:04:07.517 --> 00:04:09.383
The prince felt weak.

42
00:04:09.384 --> 00:04:12.766
He knew the end was near.

43
00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:16.920
"Will you kiss me, princess?" he asked.

44
00:04:16.921 --> 00:04:20.771
"Then I can die happy."

45
00:04:20.772 --> 00:04:23.591
"Of course."

46
00:04:23.592 --> 00:04:29.581
As she leaned forward, the princess stared at the man's face.

47
00:04:29.582 --> 00:04:38.344
And finally it struck her.

48
00:04:38.345 --> 00:04:40.205
This was her prince.

49
00:04:40.206 --> 00:04:45.654
And he was dying!

